  "historyNote": "#5172, eff 7-1-91; ss by #6535, INTERIM, eff 7-1-97, EXPIRES: 10-29-97; ss by #6619-B, eff 10-29-97; amd by #7225, eff 3-31-00; (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Sw 1000); ss by #8459, eff 10-28-05 (formerly Env-Wm 2702.04); ss by #10598, eff 7-1-14; ss by #13864, eff 2-6-24",
